      "paperId": "b604a4904ed185b411db67dc3934de3f178f2996",
      "title": "Benjamin\u2019s Phantasmagorias: Socially Necessary Semblance and the Dialectical Image of Capital",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ernest Pujol-Le\u00f3n",
          "authorId": "2390131210"
