      "paperId": "b42f1c7cb592d3e82686b1c6c3c1f53620947bf8",
      "title": "Marxism, Cultural Studies, and the \u201cPrinciple Of Historical Specification\u201d",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Douglas Spielman",
          "authorId": "49760844"
